  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your sudden thrust from a defensive stance catches your foe off-guard.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Surprise Strike<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use this feat, the target is denied its Dexterity bonus to AC against your attack. You can use this feat more than once per day by expending one use of mythic power for each additional use.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc108\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
